docs {
  ## Delete Order — Cancelled

  Tests deleting a CANCELLED order (not allowed).
  Replace `CANCELLED_ORDER_UUID` with an order in CANCELLED status.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Only pending orders can be deleted"
}
